This commit takes care of three things
1. It enables the application to parse dates before Jan 1, 1970 in case of MongoDB
2. JUnit test
3. Cypress test

## Description
Internally, [Date](https://www.mongodb.com/docs/manual/reference/bson-types/#std-label-document-bson-type-date) objects are stored as a signed 64-bit integer representing the number of milliseconds since the Unix epoch (Jan 1, 1970). In case of invalid date or date which doesn't belong to the above valid range this is found in different format. Hence our current implementation is not able to parse and the user ended up seeing JSON parsing error.

The JSON output from MongoDB driver looks like below where there are a few dates after Jan 1, 1970 and before Jan 1, 1970. See the differences in the following JSON representation

```
{
  "cursor": {
    "firstBatch": [
      {
        "name": "Bug 13285",
        "_id": {
          "$oid": "62becd2e7470ba5746a6a8b6"
        },
        "tag": "test",
        "type": "Plugin",
        "db": "Mongo"
      },
      {
        "name": "Bug 13285",
        "_id": {
          "$oid": "62becd477470ba5746a6a91b"
        },
        "tag": "test",
        "type": "Plugin",
        "invalidDate": {
          "$date": "2022-07-01T10:32:37.318Z" //date is readily available
        },
        "db": "Mongo"
      },
      {
        "name": "Bug 13285",
        "_id": {
          "$oid": "62bece987470ba5746a6add2"
        },
        "tag": "test",
        "type": "Plugin",
        "invalidDate": {
          "$date": {
            "$numberLong": "-493033770000" //date stored as 1954-05-18T14:10:30.000+00:00 in DB
          }
        },
        "db": "Mongo"
      },
      {
        "name": "Bug 13285",
        "_id": {
          "$oid": "62beceb97470ba5746a6ae24"
        },
        "tag": "test",
        "type": "Plugin",
        "invalidDate": {
          "$date": {
            "$numberLong": "-62135596800000" //date stored as 0001-01-01T00:00:00.000+00:00 in DB
          }
        },
        "db": "Mongo"
      }
    ],
    "ns": "longshot-db.testCollection",
    "id": 0
  },
  "ok": 1
}
```


Fixes #13285 


