When creating provisioners outside of CDK having a friendlier Instance Profile name makes it easier to pass it around, compared to the ugly CDK-generated name.

## Example
Without override
```ts
new Karpenter(this, 'Karpenter', {
  cluster,
  vpc,
})

// instance profile name: instanceProfile: MyStackAFA747D8-KarpenterInstanceProfileCDDAB33E-Lh74yWBWUNIu
```

With override
```ts
new Karpenter(this, 'Karpenter', {
  cluster,
  vpc,
  instanceProfileName: 'my-instance-profile
})

// instance profile name: instanceProfile: my-instance-profile
```

